Add `WEBSITE_NAME`, which sets the label of the website entry in the admin menu. Without it the entry reads "Website" in the language of the interface, which does not describe the target when `WEBSITE` points at a contact page or an imprint. There is only one such entry, so setting this means you no longer link your own website, and the value is shown as-is rather than translated. The FAQ entry on German ISP contact requirements now uses it.
